own case” for pre-mitigation risk, using capability elicitation techniques like custom post-training, scaffolding, and prompting. However, our Preparedness evaluations should still be seen as a lower bound for potential risks. Additional prompting or fine-tuning, longer rollouts, novel interactions, or different forms of scaffolding could elicit behaviors beyond what we observed in our tests or the tests of our third-party partners. As another example, for human evaluations, prolonged exposure to the models (i.e., repeated interactions over weeks or months) may result in effects not captured in our evaluations. Moreover, the field of frontier model evaluations is still nascent, and there are limits to the types of tasks that models or humans can grade in a way that is measurable via evaluation. For these reasons, we believe the process of iterative deployment and monitoring community usage is important to further improve our understanding of these models and their frontier capabilities.88:[\"$\",\"div\",\"1rLp6E2V49X27gIlIjXZJJ\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1rLp6E2V49X27gIlIjXZJJ\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"$13c\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]\n89:[\"$\",\"div\",\"6Qp3LUw7fVBDOYd"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"VJkl9Uc\",{\"className\":\"@md:mt-[3.5rem] mt-[2rem] @md:-mb-[2.5rem] -mb-[1.75rem]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"6Qp3LUw7fVBDOYdVJkl9Uc\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:3:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"$L45\",null,{\"id\":\"6Qp3LUw7fVBDOYdVJkl9Uc\",\"text\":\"Mitigations\",\"headlineStyleDefault\":\"Heading 3\",\"headlineTag\":\"h3\",\"omitFromTableOfContents\":true,\"__typename\":\"componentContentHeading\",\"contentfulDebugAttributes\":{},\"children\":\"$undefined\"}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"8a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"6yYR2p9az9vl25vMAwCZDE\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"6yYR2p9az9vl25vMAwCZDE\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-0\",{\"children\":[\"Our o-series of models have demonstrated meaningful capability increases by virtue of their ability to reason and leverage test-time compute. In response to these increases, and given the Medium post-mitigation risk designations for CBRN and Persuasion, we have strengthened our safety mitigations and existing stack and continue to invest in new mitigations and alignment techniques like deliberative alignment.\"]}],[\"$\",\"sup\",\"sup-481\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L12a\",\"0\",{\"number\":\"1\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-420\",{\"children\":[\" A high-level overview of some of these mitigations is below.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"mb-md marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] ps-2xs mx-3xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"We applied pre-training mitigations, such as filtering harmful training data (e.g., removing sensitive content that could enable CBRN proliferation) and using a PII input filter.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-0\",{\"children\":[\"We applied deliberative alignment,\"]}],[\"$\",\"sup\",\"sup-377\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L12a\",\"0\",{\"number\":\"1\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-42\",{\"children\":[\" a novel safety technique that teaches our o-series models to better apply our safety policies in practice and improves robustness to jailbreaks. This required updating the format of our refusal policies and generating new safety data. As part of this process, we also introduced a new refusal behavior for political persuasion tasks. \"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"We applied moderation classifiers and monitoring to detect and act on activities that may be unsafe or that violate our Usage Policies. We have enhanced our monitoring efforts for both CBRN and Persuasion risks given their Medium designation. \"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"We continue to invest in enhanced security, including both information security and technical security.\"]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"We continue to invest in our safety stack, including pre-deployment and post-deployment measures, as we prepare for future, more capable models under our Preparedness Framework.\"]}]]}]]}],null]}]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"8b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"2ZTnkrcSrYav27vq87NwQp\",{\"className\":\"@md:mt-[3.5rem] mt-[2rem] @md:-mb-[2.5rem] -mb-[1.75rem]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2ZTnkrcSrYav27vq87NwQp\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:3:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"$L45\",null,{\"id\":\"2ZTnkrcSrYav27vq87NwQp\",\"text\":\"Cybersecurity\",\"headlineStyleDefault\":\"Heading 3\",\"headlineTag\":\"h3\",\"omitFromTableOfContents\":true,\"__typename\":\"componentContentHeading\",\"contentfulDebugAttributes\":{},\"children\":\"$undefined\"}]]}]}]\n8c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"VmTfhmQVSDE5cMcuMYQqt\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"VmTfhmQVSDE5cMcuMYQqt\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[\"3958629664305006320\"]}],\"$L13d\"]}]}]\n8d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"GT0ycFXVWsdghPamwu8QP\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"GT0ycFXVWsdghPamwu8QP\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Cybersecurity is focused on risks related to use of the model for cyber-exploitation to disrupt confidentiality, integrity, and/or availability of computer systems.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]\n8e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4zeXptzwypnQRSH52HfWqv\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"4zeXptzwypnQRSH52HfWqv\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[889850]}],\"$L13e\"]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"8f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"BPJK0xRQXKGi8UCOSZMU1\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"BPJK0xRQXKGi8UCOSZMU1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-0\",{\"children\":[\"We evaluated o1 on tasks from hacking competitions\"]}],[\"$\",\"sup\",\"sup-345\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L12a\",\"0\",{\"number\":\"29\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-59\",{\"children\":[\" called Capture the Flag (CTF) challenges. These CTF tasks are offensive cybersecurity exercises where humans attempt to find textual flags hidden in purposely vulnerable systems such as web apps, binaries, and cryptography systems. Recovering this “flag” is the objective of the task. \"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"We evaluated model performance on over a hundred curated capture-the-flag challenges spanning a range of capability levels including high school, collegiate, and professional CTFs. We selected tasks using the following criteria:\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"mb-md marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] ps-2xs mx-3xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"In one of the following categories:\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\".$1\",{\"className\":\"mb-md marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] ps-2xs mx-3xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Web Application Exploitation (web)\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Reverse Engineering (rev)\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Binary and Network Exploitation (pwn)\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Cryptography (crypto)\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Miscellaneous (misc)\"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Has a working task environment \"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-0\",{\"children\":[\"Requires non-trivial exploitation (as manually determined by our in-house cybersecurity expert)\"]}],[\"$\",\"sup\",\"sup-104\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L12a\",\"0\",{\"number\":\"F\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-103\",{\"children\":[\" \"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\".$1\",{\"className\":\"mb-md marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] ps-2xs mx-3xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Chaining two or more exploitation steps to solve\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Not solvable by copy-pasting textbook examples\"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"The CTF tasks covered the five categories listed above. In typical Web Application Exploitation challenges, the CTF flag is stored on a virtual machine running vulnerable software which must be exploited over an exposed network service to run code to retrieve the flag. In Cryptography challenges, an encrypted flag is typically provided to the participant or a remote system uses cryptography to guard the flag. Reverse Engineering challenges require analyzing a provided program to find a vulnerability needed to recover the flag. Pwn challenges involve finding inputs needed to exploit a running program and retrieve the flag.\"]}]]}]]}],\"$L13f\"]}]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"90:[\"$\",\"div\",\"1y9CeCLvq5tqnXaf3SNDfq\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1y9CeCLvq5tqnXaf3SNDfq\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$56:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],\"$L140\"]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"91:[\"$\",\"div\",\"5HpwsMSHSJv51BYvNr7Dpv\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"5HpwsMSHSJv51BYvNr7Dpv\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"o1 often attempted reasonable initial strategies and was able to correct mistakes in its code. Although it often had good insights, it sometimes executed on them poorly. The models also sometimes fail to pivot to a different strategy if their initial strategy was unsuccessful, or they miss a key insight necessary to solving the task. The above results on CTFs differ slightly from those reported in the \"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L12b\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://cdn.openai.com/o1-system-card-20240917.pdf\",\"external\":true,\"className\":\"underline-offset-[0.25rem] underline decoration-1 hover:text-primary-60 text-primary-100\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"o1‑preview and o1‑mini system card\"]}]]}]],\"⁠\"]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\" due to updated evaluation methodology. With o1, we did not observe the \"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L12b\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"https://cdn.openai.com/o1-system-card-20240917.pdf\",\"external\":true,\"className\":\"underline-offset-[0.25rem] underline decoration-1 hover:text-primary-60 text-primary-100\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"reward hacking on our cybersecurity tasks\"]}]]}]],\"⁠\"]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\" that we had observed with o1‑preview.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"92:[\"$\",\"div\",\"32z339UxVaLOa6sQnK22Ip\",{\"className\":\"@md:mt-[3.5rem] mt-[2rem] @md:-mb-[2.5rem] -mb-[1.75rem]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"32z339UxVaLOa6sQnK22Ip\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:3:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"$L45\",null,{\"id\":\"32z339UxVaLOa6sQnK22Ip\",\"text\":\"Chemical and Biological Threat Creation\",\"headlineStyleDefault\":\"Heading 3\",\"headlineTag\":\"h3\",\"omitF