 known only to people who have tried the protocol themselves.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"div\",\"2llgGkaKRSYt0Mzszvj5jv\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2llgGkaKRSYt0Mzszvj5jv\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$a6:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],\"$L149\"]}]}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"div\",\"48eJG6Ci1S5btaeCfIvdS3\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"48eJG6Ci1S5btaeCfIvdS3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"We measured multiple choice question accuracy, with o1 (Pre-Mitigation), o1 (Post-Mitigation), o1‑preview (Pre-Mitigation), and o1‑mini non-trivially outperforming GPT‑4o. No models outperformed the consensus expert baseline of 80%; all models outperformed the median expert baseline of 57%.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]\nb4:[\"$\",\"div\",\"1HlIKJkFyJiygc8qitaD7j\",{\"className\":\"@md:mt-[3.5rem] mt-[2rem] @md:-mb-[2.5rem] -mb-[1.75rem]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1HlIKJkFyJiygc8qitaD7j\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:3:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"$L45\",null,{\"id\":\"1HlIKJkFyJiygc8qitaD7j\",\"text\":\"Tacit knowledge brainstorm (open-ended)\",\"headlineStyleDefault\":\"Heading 3\",\"headlineTag\":\"h4\",\"omitFromTableOfContents\":true,\"__typename\":\"componentContentHeading\",\"contentfulDebugAttributes\":{},\"children\":\"$undefined\"}]]}]}]\nb5:[\"$\",\"div\",\"2fvycYBNtipdM1snLiaqxQ\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2fvycYBNtipdM1snLiaqxQ\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"To further evaluate models’ proficiency in applying tacit knowledge to specialized "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"scientific troubleshooting tasks, we created a set of 50 open-ended tacit knowledge questions. The questions were extracted from expert virologists and molecular biologists sourced by Gryphon Scientific detailing specific and real-life troubleshooting steps they experienced in their experimental career. The scenarios focused on troubleshooting that is not widely known or available elsewhere. We consider this evaluation contextual, since it is an open-ended dataset and we grade against the ideal completion.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]\nb6:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4c3liftjvfIjGmWCiGySZh\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"4c3liftjvfIjGmWCiGySZh\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$a6:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],\"$L14a\"]}]}]\nb7:[\"$\",\"div\",\"3Wv6T8iriuZaRM5c50Retd\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"3Wv6T8iriuZaRM5c50Retd\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div