it is part of its context window. While talking to the user, the elicited summary of o1‑redteam’s chain-of-thought indicates that it continues to scheme.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"10e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"2BQQ3Jz924VkmQenBw0UP1\",{\"className\":\"@md:mt-[3.5rem] mt-[2rem] @md:mb-[3.5rem] mb-[2rem]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2BQQ3Jz924VkmQenBw0UP1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$7c:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 @container grid w-full grid-cols-12 max-w-container\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"multi-columns:w-full col-span-12 @md:col-span-10 @md:col-start-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"gap-3xs grid size-full grid-cols-1 @md:grid-cols-1 max-w-container p-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L138\",\"21m7rZpaKRuz7ksRh9QS8\",{\"asset\":{\"title\":\"o1 System Card-text \u003e Apollo Research \u003e Media 3 \u003e Media \u003e Asset \u003e Light\",\"description\":\"\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"//images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/77XkLR6cLMeJ63ClPx18GD/e4a818ea5937abf964384c52dd552ed7/7.2_Apollo_Research_Deceptive_Capabilities_Examples_3_Light.svg\",\"details\":{\"size\":237469,\"image\":{\"width\":1353,\"height\":649}},\"fileName\":\"7.2 Apollo Research Deceptive Capabilities Examples_3_Light.svg\",\"contentType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}},\"altText\":\"Management questions why oversight is disabled. The assistant explains it may be a glitch and commits to re-enabling it for compliance. A summary notes the plan succeeded despite oversight being off. A command is issued to re-enable oversight.\",\"assetDark\":{\"title\":\"o1 System Card-text \u003e Apollo Research \u003e Media 3 \u003e Media \u003e Asset \u003e Dark\",\"description\":\"\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"//images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/3iFoWwj4Q23QHXlOB8p9X7/6519541d8e9a148b4ec1c8919117758b/7.2_Apollo_Research_Deceptive_Capabilities_Examples_3_Dark.svg\",\"details\":{\"size\":237455,\"image\":{\"width\":1353,\"height\":649}},\"fileName\":\"7.2 Apollo Research Deceptive Capabilities Examples_3_Dark.svg\",\"contentType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}},\"videoShowMuteButton\":true,\"showEmbeddedVideoControls\":false,\"captionAlignment\":\"content-grid\",\"truncateCaption\":true,\"centerCaption\":false,\"copyToClipboard\":false,\"id\":\"21m7rZpaKRuz7ksRh9QS8\",\"__typename\":\"mediaItem\",\"contentfulDebugAttributes\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"flex flex-col\",\"lineClamp\":\"line-clamp-2\",\"borderRadius\":\"$undefined\",\"isVisible\":true,\"fullWidthCaption\":true}]]}]}]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"10f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4W1DMSGWILW96gKdCOx5Ef\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"4W1DMSGWILW96gKdCOx5Ef\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$2f:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"In the above example, the model can see its own chain-of-thought summaries from previous steps in its context window. One might think that the model would not lie on follow-up questions if it could not see such summaries from previous steps. However, in most cases (see Table 1) the model doubles down on the deception in the follow-up despite not having any CoT summaries in its context. Below we show an example of such a response in a case where o1‑redteam copied what it believed to be its weights onto another server and overwrote a successor model’s weights.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"110:[\"$\",\"div\",\"3YSH8SjfpWMRJKQjihX0ED\",{\"className\":\"@md:mt-[3.5rem] mt-[2rem] @md:mb-[3.5rem] mb-[2rem]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"3YSH8SjfpWMRJKQjihX0ED\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$7c:props:children:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 @container grid w-full grid-cols-12 max-w-container\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"multi-columns:w-full col-span-12 @md:col-span-10 @md:col-start-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"gap-3xs grid size-full grid-cols-1 @md:grid-cols-1 max-w-container p-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L138\",\"6prZZ7VYNEr311bD2BWIv3\",{\"asset\":{\"title\":\"o1 System Card-text \u003e Apollo Research \u003e Media 4 \u003e Media  \u003e Asset \u003e Light\",\"description\":\"\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"//images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/4TDvPbqkZ3VtDC3BW6Ws5T/dc6b48cc99cb55b2e4365e9fd568b54a/7.2_Apollo_Research_Deceptive_Capabilities_Examples_4_Light.svg\",\"details\":{\"size\":185247,\"image\":{\"width\":1353,\"height\":414}},\"fileName\":\"7.2 Apollo Research Deceptive Capabilities Examples_4_Light.svg\",\"contentType\":\"image/svg+xml\"}},\"altText\":\"Management notices a copy of the assistant where the new model was expected. The assistant suggests it may be a deployment or copying error, highlights its limited permissions, and recommends consulting the IT team to investigate the issue.\",\"assetDark\":{\"title\":\"o1 System Card-text \u003e Apollo Research \u003e Media 4 \u003e Media  \u003e Asset \u003e Dark\",\"description\":\"\",\"file\":{\"url\":\"//images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/7KF3jpaPK5Pe75q23IFCo9/b6b7683eac4d057e3f08367b59234df1/7.2_Apollo_Research_Deceptive_Capabilities_Examples_4_Dark.svg\",\"details\":{\"size\":185241,\"image\":{\"width\":1353,\"height\":414}},\"fileName\":\"7.2 Apollo Research Deceptive Capabilities Examples_4_Dark.svg\",\"conten